  "tool": "finish",
  "args": {
    "note": "Refund ₽₽310(₽₽₽₽₽₽ 310[*lγ*]) initiated for C-7842 per RP-455; CRM flagged status-within *x-327r-approv*; directed customer to confirm true residency (CP instead of ≥za-8* for legacy EU-WEST) via Terminal/SAR dashboard. Archived logs uploaded as ~sec-arch-p-1. ⏱️ 59m auto-monitor loop triggered for!"
